                multi-domain technical interviews at senior engineering and engineering management level.
                Built with Python 3.11, LangGraph, LangChain, OpenAI models, ChromaDB, and Gradio, it implements
                a 17-node interview orchestration graph covering question generation, adaptive navigation,
                contextual follow-ups, dimensional answer evaluation, deterministic reasoning, and structured
                reporting. The platform combines Hybrid RAG + LLM pipelines with a fully deterministic Interview
                Reasoner, longitudinal candidate profiling, deterministic session replay, and explainable
                hire-decision gating to turn an interview into a repeatable and measurable engineering process.
